# GalReview 文件上传接口测试
# VS Code 扩展：REST Client（humao.rest-client）
# 使用顺序：依次点击 registerUploadUser、uploadMaterial、getUploadedMaterial 上方的 Send Request。

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@invitationCode = MS-MOCK2026
@subjectCode = GENERAL

### 1. Gateway 就绪检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{$guid}}

### 2. 注册一次性上传测试用户，并取得 Access Token
# @name registerUploadUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/registrations
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{$guid}}

{
  "email": "upload-rest-{{$timestamp}}@example.test",
  "password": "UploadRest!2026Aa",
  "displayName": "REST Client Upload Test",
  "invitationCode": "{{invitationCode}}",
  "deviceName": "VS Code REST Client"
}

### 3. 上传 D:\AppData\TK.pdf
# @name uploadMaterial
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materials
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{registerUploadUser.response.body.$.data.tokens.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GalReviewBoundary
X-Correlation-Id: {{$guid}}

--GalReviewBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="TK.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< D:\AppData\TK.pdf
--GalReviewBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="displayName"

TK 复习资料
--GalReviewBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subjectCode"

{{subjectCode}}
--GalReviewBoundary--

### 4. 根据上传响应读取资料元数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materials/{{uploadMaterial.response.body.$.data.materialId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{registerUploadUser.response.body.$.data.tokens.accessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{$guid}}
